度净亏损 233 亿美元，高于去年同期的 121 亿美元。","reportEdition":"2026-11-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","title":"OpenAI 训练并部署激活分类器作为前沿模型安全监控层","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T00:00:32.882Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","https://alignment.openai.com/training-activation-classifiers"],"articles":[{"id":"wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","title":"OpenAI 训练并部署激活分类器作为前沿模型安全监控层","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 自 GPT-5.6 起在其最强模型的内部和外部流量上部署激活分类器（probes），利用模型内部激活逐 token 实时评分，可在生成中途阻断违规回复和工具调用并交由推理模型复审。实验显示 probes 比更大的文本分类器对测试的越狱攻击更鲁棒，准确率随模型能力提升，且在后训练各检查点间迁移良好，但需为新基础模型重新训练，且只能检测可显式训练的已知违规类型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","originalUrl":"https://alignment.openai.com/training-activation-classifiers","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T00:00:32.882Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-140i0f","originalSourceName":"OpenAI：Alignment 研究博客（RSS）","family":"openai","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-140i0f","name":"OpenAI：Alignment 研究博客（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"OpenAI 自 GPT-5.6 起在其最强模型的内部和外部流量上部署激活分类器（probes），利用模型内部激活逐 token 实时评分，可在生成中途阻断违规回复和工具调用并交由推理模型复审。实验显示 probes 比更大的文本分类器对测试的越狱攻击更鲁棒，准确率随模型能力提升，且在后训练各检查点间迁移良好，但需为新基础模型重新训练，且只能检测可显式训练的已知违规类型。","reportEdition":"2026-11-03","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/dzwfvd9xp6v4qaj6olxezpier","title":"数字生命卡兹克分享折腾一年的Agent自动化系统架构","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T00:00:32.882Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/dzwfvd9xp6v4qaj6olxezpier","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647688060&idx=1&sn=e00d7e57b6f0e3670f0e267e677047df"],"articles":[{"id":"dzwfvd9xp6v4qaj6olxezpier","title":"数字生命卡兹克分享折腾一年的Agent自动化系统架构","originalTitle":"","summary":"自媒体作者卡兹克分享自己搭建近一年的Agent自动化系统，核心是把任务起点从人身上移开，由事件触发Agent工作。系统分为自动化中台、Agent执行、CI中台和飞书决策四层：中台用rules.json统一管理事件触发和Agent调度，本地MacMini跑Agent任务，自建CI中台完成审查、检查、合并、发布、核实五步，只在删数据、花钱、改方向等关键决策时通过飞书卡片找作者拍板。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/dzwfvd9xp6v4qaj6olxezpier","originalUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647688060&idx=1&sn=e00d7e57b6f0e3670f0e267e677047df","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T00:00:32.882Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1lw5i0n","originalSourceName":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","family":"outlet-1u4xzx7","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/dzwfvd9xp6v4qaj6olxezpier","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1lw5i0n","name":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"自媒体作者卡兹克分享自己搭建近一年的Agent自动化系统，核心是把任务起点从人身上移开，由事件触发Agent工作。系统分为自动化中台、Agent执行、CI中台和飞书决策四层：中台用rules.j